# The audio is committed. It is what this pack exists to carry, and the
# CurseForge packager builds from a tagged commit -- so a repository without it
# publishes an addon that installs, loads, and is silent, which is worse than
# one that fails. Held back until now for a reason that has expired: while the
# words were still being spoken, committing half of them and adding the rest
# later would have written the full size into history twice, and git saves
# nothing at all between two renderings of the same clip.

/release/
/curseforge/
*.zip
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
